{
  name: "item-liquid-teleport",
  displayName: "Item Liquid Teleport",
  author: "namds666 & Claude Code & Codex",
  subtitle: "v1.4.21: New Chrono art, boosters react at once",
  description: "Cheat-grade Chrono blocks for global item and liquid transport, terrain and item conversion, repair, construction, overdrive, unit buffs and debuffs, mind control, and core placement, plus the Outpost, a base that builds mining drones.\n\n[accent]v1.4.21[]\nNew Chrono art: every block has its own glyph and a purple frame, and status icons show their stat. Boosters, buffers and debuffers use new items at once. Chrono Mender: flashes only on big hits. Chrono Repair Point: turns toward its target. Yuri: shows team colour, and conversions show a purple ring.\n\n[accent]v1.4.20[]\nEach Chrono Build Tower now takes its own plan from your build queue, so more towers build more blocks at the same time. They also build your plans when you are far away.\n\n[accent]v1.4.19[]\nYuri's range is now 60 tiles, up from 30.\n\n[accent]v1.4.18[]\nYuri now finds targets within its own 30 tile range around itself, so it keeps converting wherever it walks. Upgrades now only shorten the channel time.\n\n[accent]v1.4.17[]\nChrono Hypno is now 1x1. Four in a 2x2 square merge into a Big Chrono Hypno, whose Big Yuri tethers two targets at once. More Yuri on one target convert it faster: two Yuri take half the time.",
  version: "1.4.21",
  minGameVersion: "146"
}
